<!--
    Just the cloud — now ink on a pale plate rather than pale on a dark one.

    That inversion is the whole redesign, and it is not a colour swap for its own sake. The
    reference this app now follows is black-on-white everywhere and reserves colour for the one
    place it means something; an icon that answered with a dark slab was the last piece of the old
    warm-toned identity still on the home screen. A near-black mark on near-white is also the more
    confident choice among a screen of saturated gradients.

    The construction is unchanged and deliberately so: a union of three overlapping discs over a
    stadium-shaped base, rather than one traced outline. The union of simple circles is what gives
    the mark its soft, even bumps, and each piece stays readable at 48dp where a hand-tuned bezier
    turns to mush. A stroked outline was tried instead — closer to the reference's drawn mascot —
    and abandoned: eroding a union of discs to make the inner counter leaves ink slivers in the
    crevices wherever two discs meet shallowly, which at launcher size looks like a rendering fault.

    What did change is proportion. The mark is wider, flatter and smaller than before, and it is now
    centred exactly: the silhouette spans 23.4..84.6 horizontally and 29.4..78.7 vertically, both
    centred on 54. The old drawing filled its safe zone edge to edge, which on a circular launcher
    mask left the base almost touching the plate; pulling it in to roughly 85% is what buys the
    margin the reference design would insist on.

    The billows stay tucked inside the base's full width — the base's caps reach 23.4 and 84.6, the
    billows only 24.8 and 82 — so the caps define the silhouette low down and the billows define it
    up top. Lining their outer edges up exactly instead puts a visible dent in each side where the
    two arcs cross. Every billow's lowest point sits below the base's top edge (59.5), which is what
    fuses four separate paths into one silhouette with no seam.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">
    <!-- Flat-bottomed base with fully rounded ends; the caps reach x=23.4 and x=84.6. -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#0A0A0A"
        android:pathData="M33,59.5 L75,59.5 A9.6,9.6 0 0,1 75,78.7 L33,78.7 A9.6,9.6 0 0,1 33,59.5 Z" />
    <!-- The tall middle billow, centred at (53,47). -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#0A0A0A"
        android:pathData="M35.4,47 a17.6,17.6 0 1,0 35.2,0 a17.6,17.6 0 1,0 -35.2,0 Z" />
    <!-- Right shoulder, centred at (68,56). -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#0A0A0A"
        android:pathData="M54,56 a14,14 0 1,0 28,0 a14,14 0 1,0 -28,0 Z" />
    <!-- Left shoulder, the smallest of the three, centred at (38,57.5). -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#0A0A0A"
        android:pathData="M24.8,57.5 a13.2,13.2 0 1,0 26.4,0 a13.2,13.2 0 1,0 -26.4,0 Z" />
</vector>
